<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.25-0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.25-0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was</p>
<p>moderate. Compared with Tuesday, barrows and gilts were $0.25</p>
<p>to $0.50 lower. Top $51.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     51.50-51.75</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     51.00-51.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     49.00-50.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     47.00-48.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.25. Top $49.25.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-450 lbs     42.50</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     45.50-45.75</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs     49.00-49.25</p>
</text>
